              <td>⚪ ABORTED</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Smoke_A900_npupool</strong></td>\n                        <td>⚪ ABORTED</td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-03-06 17:41:34] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行失败 </p>","created_at":"2026-03-06T17:33:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-06T17:41:34+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164527970,"discussion_id":"076e377dd5b0a2bb7fbbf6425357e249c2d63d42","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR修复了`repeat_interleave_grad`算子内核在处理重复因子`r`为零或一（`r=0`或`r=1`）时的逻辑缺陷。原实现在此边界情况下，后续的归约求和计算可能产生未定义行为、性能浪费或导致输出张量写入错误，影响梯度计算的正确性。本次修改旨在通过特殊处理逻辑，确保在这些场景下能高效且正确地输出全零结果。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n核心修改是在`ProcessRepeatBlock`函数中新增了对`r=0`和`r=1`的特殊处理分支。具体实现包括：1）新增`ProcessZeroR`辅助函数，用于将计算缓冲区初始化为常量零值并安全写回全局内存；2）当`r=1`时，直接调用`ProcessZeroR`处理单个元素；3）当`r=0`时，根据基础块大小对N轴进行重新切分，并循环调用`ProcessZeroR`，以零值填充该重复因子对应的整个输出区域。此方案优化了边界情况下的性能与正确性，避免了潜在的除零或无效循环风险。","created_at":"2026-03-06T17:33:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-06T17:33:53+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164557761,"discussion_id":"6905adb4edc8ad10a577bf102b50ea7afc610f90","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in thi